# MSSP Control Plane — Always-Applied Project Rules

This project is a private, multi-tenant, AI-assisted MSSP/SOC control plane. Full detail lives in `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and `CONTEXT.md` at the repository root — read them.

**Source of truth:** Git tags/commits and validation-script PASS lines beat stale docs. Always inspect current files before planning. Do not implement before planning is reviewed/approved (unless the user already provided an approved implement scope).

## Project Summary

- Branded web MSSP/SOC control plane — not a Wazuh UI, not Streamlit-as-product.
- Architecture: FastAPI + PostgreSQL + Redis + Docker Compose; admin UI (`frontend-admin`, :3000) and customer UI (`frontend-customer`, :3001).
- Wazuh/Suricata/etc. are backend adapters only.
- Multi-tenant: admin/SOC sees cross-tenant tools; customers see only their tenant.

